Usage:
  codebase-memory-mcp cli get_architecture --flag value [--flag2 value2 ...]
  codebase-memory-mcp cli get_architecture --args-file <path-to-json>
  echo '<json>' | codebase-memory-mcp cli get_architecture
  codebase-memory-mcp cli get_architecture '<raw-json-args>'

Flags:
  --project <string> [required]
  --path <string>  Directory prefix (for example apps/hoa).
  --aspects <array>  all=everything; overview=compact except file_tree; omitted=languages/packages/entry_points; cycles is opt-in.
  --format <tree|json> [default: tree]
